# Images of the recording stack, pinned by digest. render.sh sources this file.
# The AIM images are the ones docker-compose.quickstart.yml names, resolved from
# the `edge` tag on 2026-09-23 (aim-server built from dfc5719, aim-dashboard from
# dcb7f5b, both after 30ca485, the commit that added the device login and the
# consent page). Re-resolve with:
#   docker buildx imagetools inspect ghcr.io/opena2a-org/aim-server:edge --format '{{.Manifest.Digest}}'
